    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ammaantii Daarta Oo Soo Noqotay",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo markaas dabadeedna wuxuu i keenay iriddii xagga bari u sii jeedday. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo bal eeg, sharaftii Ilaaha reer binu Israa'iil ayaa xagga bari ka timid, oo codkiisuna wuxuu u ekaa sidii biyo badan sanqadhood, oo dhulkuna sharaftiisuu la dhalaalay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo waxyaalihii lay tusay waxay u ekaayeen sidii waxyaalihii hore ee aan arkay; sidii waxyaalihii aan arkay markuu u yimid inuu magaalada dumiyo ayay u ekaayeen, oo waxyaalihii aan arkay waxay u ekaayeen sidii waxyaalihii aan Webi Kebaar agtiisa ku arkay oo kale; oo aniguna wejigaan u dhacay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo sharaftii Rabbigu waxay daartii ka soo gashay jidkii iriddii xagga bari u sii jeedday. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo Ruuxii ayaa kor ii soo qaaday, oo wuxuu i geeyey barxaddii gudaha, oo bal eeg, sharaftii Rabbiga ayaa daartii buuxisay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo waxaan maqlay qof daarta igala soo hadlaya, oo nin baa i garab taagnaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo wuxuu igu yidhi, Wiilka Aadamow, halkanu waa meeshii carshigayga, iyo meeshii cagahayga, iyo meeshii aan reer binu Israa'iil weligay dhex degganaan doono, oo reer binu Israa'iil ama boqorradoodu mar dambe magacayga quduuska ah kuma ay nijaasayn doonaan dhillanimadooda amase meydka boqorradooda oo meelahooda sare yaal. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waxay iriddooda marinkeeda ka taageen iriddayda marinkeeda agtiisa, oo tiirkoodiina waxay ka ag taageen tiirkayga, oo derbigii qudha ayaa aniga iyo iyaga noo dhexeeyey, oo magacayga quduuska ahna waxay ku nijaaseeyeen waxyaalahoodii karaahiyada ahaa ee ay sameeyeen, sidaas daraaddeed cadhadaydii waan ku baabbi'iyey. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haddaba iyagu bal dhillanimadooda iyo meydka boqorradooda ha iga fogeeyeen, oo aniguna weligayba dhexdoodaan degganaan doonaa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wiilka Aadamow, bal waxaad reer binu Israa'iil tustaa daarta si ay xumaatooyinkooda ugu wada ceeboobaan, oo bal tilmaanta ha qiyaaseen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo hadday wixii ay sameeyeen oo dhan ku ceeboobaan, waxaad tustaa daarta qaabkeeda, iyo qabanqaabkeeda, iyo meelaha laga baxo, iyo meelaha laga soo galo, iyo qaabkeeda oo dhan, iyo qaynuunnadeeda oo dhan, iyo qaabkeeda oo dhan, iyo sharciyadeeda oo dhan, oo iyagoo indhaha ku haya qor, si ay qaabkeeda oo dhan u sii dhawraan, oo ay qaynuunnadeeda oo dhan u wada sameeyaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kanu waa sharcigii daarta: buurta dhaladeeda hareereheeda oo dhammu wuxuu ahaan doonaa waxa ugu wada quduusan. Bal eeg, kaasu waa sharcigii daarta.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Meeshii Allabariga",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo kanuna waa qiyaastii meesha allabariga oo lagu qiyaaso dhudhun dheer kaasoo ah dhudhun iyo taako. Salku wuxuu ahaan doonaa dhudhun, ballaadhkuna dhudhun, oo qarka hareeraha ku wareegsanuna taako, oo kaasu wuxuu ahaan doonaa meesha allabariga aasaaskeeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo salka uu dhulka ku hayo iyo ilaa qarka hoose wuxuu ahaan doonaa laba dhudhun, oo ballaadhkuna dhudhun, oo qarka yar iyo qarka weyn inta u dhexaysaana afar dhudhun, oo ballaadhkuna dhudhun. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Meesha allabariga inteeda sare waxay ahaan doontaa afar dhudhun, oo meesha allabariga meesheeda dabka lagu shido iyo ilaa dhankeeda sare waxaa ku oolli doona afar gees. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo meesha allabariga meesheeda dabka lagu shido dhererkeedu wuxuu ahaan doonaa laba iyo toban dhudhun, oo ballaadhkeeduna laba iyo toban dhudhun, iyadoo afar gees ah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo qarka dhererkiisuna wuxuu ahaan doonaa afar iyo toban dhudhun, ballaadhkiisuna afar iyo toban dhudhun, oo weliba afar gees ah, oo darafka ku wareegsanuna wuxuu ahaan doonaa nus dhudhun, oo salkuna wuxuu ahaan doonaa dhudhun, jaranjarraduna waxay u sii jeedi doontaa xagga bari.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasuu igu yidhi, Wiilka Aadamow, Sayidka Rabbiga ahu wuxuu leeyahay, Kuwanu waa qaynuunnada meesha allabariga maalintay sameeyaan inay qurbaanno la gubo ku kor bixiyaan oo ay dhiig ku kor rusheeyaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sayidka Rabbiga ahu wuxuu leeyahay, Wadaaddada reer Laawi oo ah farcankii Saadooq, oo iigu soo dhowaada inay ii adeegaan, waxaad siisaa dibi yar oo qurbaan dembi loo bixiyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo waa inaad dhiiggiisa wax ka qaaddaa, oo waa inaad marisaa meesha allabariga afarteeda gees iyo qarka afartiisa rukun iyo darafkiisa ku wareegsan, oo sidaas waa inaad u nadiifisaa oo ugu kafaaragguddaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo weliba waxaad qaaddaa dibiga qurbaanka dembiga ah, oo isaga waa inuu ku gubaa meeshii loo amray ee daarta oo ah meesha quduuska ah dibaddeeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo maalinta labaadna waa inaad qurbaan dembi u bixisaa orgi yar oo aan iin lahayn, oo waa in meesha allabariga la nadiifiyo sidii dibigii loogu nadiifiyey oo kale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo markaad nadiifinteeda dhammaysid waa inaad bixisaa dibi yar oo aan iin lahayn iyo wan aan iin lahayn. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo iyaga waa inaad u dhowaysaa Rabbiga hortiisa, oo wadaaddaduna waa inay cusbo ku kor shubaan, oo waa inay qurbaan la gubo Rabbiga ugu bixiyaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo intii toddoba maalmood ah waa inaad maalin kasta orgi qurbaan dembi ah diyaarisaa, oo weliba waa in dibi yar iyo wan aan iin lahayn la diyaariyaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Intii toddoba maalmood ah waa in meesha allabariga loo kafaaraggudaa oo la daahiriyaa, oo sidaasaa quduus looga dhigi doonaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo Sayidka Rabbiga ahu wuxuu leeyahay, Markay maalmahaasu dhammaadaan, maalinta siddeedaad iyo intii ka dambaysa wadaaddadu waa inay meesha allabariga ku kor bixiyaan qurbaannadiinna la gubo iyo qurbaannadiinna nabaadiinoba, oo aniguna waan idin aqbali doonaa.",
